<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45154" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spūmōsus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		spuma. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>full of foam</i>, <i>foaming</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in
			postAug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">unda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 6, 174</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">litora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					64, 121</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					1, 570</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aequor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					2, 627</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">morsus equi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. IV. Cons. Hon. 548</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spumosus nec sanguineus (pulmo),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 37, 72, § 188</span></i>
			.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Addua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. VI. Cons. Hon. 458</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carmen,</span>”
				<i>frothy</i>, <i>bombastic</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					1, 96</span></i>
			.</div>
